# text_old = Fundi enim eius propter culturam iucundiore spectaculo sunt multis, quam regie polita aedificia aliorum, cum huius spectatum veniant villas, non, ut apud Lucullum, ut videant pinacothecas, sed oporothecas.
# text = fundi enim eius propter culturam iucundiore spectaculo sunt multis, quam regie polita aedificia aliorum, cum huius spectatum veniant villas, non, ut apud Lucullum, ut videant pinacothecas, sed oporothecas.
# text_en = For his farms, on account of their cultivation, are a more pleasant spectacle to many than the royally adorned buildings of others, when they come to view his villas - not, as at Lucullus’s, to see picture-galleries, but fruit-galleries.
# text_fr = Car ses fermes, en raison de leur culture, offrent à beaucoup un spectacle plus agréable que les bâtiments royalement ornés des autres, lorsqu’ils viennent visiter ses villas - non, comme chez Lucullus, pour voir des pinacothèques, mais des oporothèques.
# text_fi = Sillä hänen tilansa ovat viljelynsä ansiosta monelle miellyttävämpi näky kuin toisten kuninkaallisesti koristellut rakennukset, kun he tulevat katsomaan hänen huviloitaan - ei, niin kuin Luculluksen luona, nähdäkseen taidegallerioita, vaan hedelmätarhoja.
